 type checks.
+
+## Coupled-status ownership
+
+`coupled-status` is a read-only projection owned by `src/coupled_status.rs`. It
+reads the native version-1 `iterations.json` manifest and durable
+`state/tui-work.json` ledgers; it does not add or alter persistent state. Task
+request counts charge work to the task, while wire request counts include every
+durable request. Missing interrupted ledgers preserve unknown usage as `null`,
+not zero. The command reports recorded native completion only; it is not an
+independent verification or promotion decision.
